<p>Question.</p>
<p>If it is getting ever louder, presumably that means it can be heard from further away, which presumably means more people will be hearing it, making them part of the audience. Why would that not stem the growing noise? Once the sound gets loud enough, the sound may reach a major population center, and then boom, millions of people listening to it.</p>

