														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1795228">
									

<p>I actually considered this chain of thought during composition. If and when this were to occur, it would at the very least blow the Foundation's cover. How would you explain a vinyl disc producing sounds of this magnitude? In any case, someone would probably try to destroy it&#8230;in which case it relocates to the nearest device and causes even more destruction.</p>
<p>If a city suddenly hears an immensely loud recording of &quot;Winter Road&quot;, they're not just gonna sit there and listen to it and think &quot;oh, that's cool&quot;. It would cause chaos.</p>
<p>Also, the amount of people required gets higher as it gets louder&#8230;perhaps I should make that rate exponential and include a mathematical model (so even a city wouldn't be able to stem the growth).</p>

